@startuml Protected Resources
title Accessing Protected Resources

actor User
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "API Backend" as API
participant "Database" as DB

User -> App: Request data from app
App -> API: GET /api/protected-endpoint\nAuthorization: Bearer <access_token>
API -> API: Decode JWT access token
API -> API: Verify token signature with SECRET_KEY
API -> API: Check token expiration
API -> API: Extract user_id from "sub_id" claim
API -> API: Verify "sub_type" is "user"
API -> DB: Process request with user context
DB -> API: Return requested data
API -> App: Return data with status 200
App -> User: Display data

@enduml
